-- SNOWGRAVE TOOL  (client only, no server script)
-- Works on R6 and R15. Tries asset 1 (Snowgrave tool R6), then asset 2 (Snowgrave DELTARUNE
-- tool SCRIPTED). Their own scripts are removed (a server script cannot
-- run from the client), the model / sounds / animations are kept and the
-- Snowgrave spell itself is run by this script. If neither asset can be
-- loaded, a built-in Snowgrave staff is made instead.
-- Click (or tap): pray pose, snow flies to the sky, beam falls where you aimed.
-- =====================================================================
